{"text":"At six, Nina’s phone said, “Time for the gym.” She was still in a meeting. The reminder was on time. Her plan wasn’t. She’d picked six because it sounded reasonable, then filled the same hour with work. By evening, “I’ll go tomorrow” felt easier than planning again. What if she checked the space in her day first? That’s the idea behind Habitnex: habits planned around your calendar. Here’s the actual app calendar, and a coach conversation asking, “Keep missing gym. When am I free?” It returns available windows to consider. No magical extra hours. Just a clearer starting point. Habitnex is in development. Join the waitlist at Habitnex dot io.","direction":"[natural, conversational, lively] ","voice":"Charlie - Deep, Confident, Energetic","model":"eleven_v4","cost":"682","start":[0,0.016,0.021,0.023,0.025,0.027,0.028,0.03,0.032,0.043,0.053,0.057,0.06,0.064,0.067,0.069,0.072,0.075,0.076,0.078,0.079,0.081,0.082,0.084,0.085,0.096,0.107,0.117,0.119,0.122,0.124,0.126,0.128,0.139,0.149,0.155,0.16,0.24,0.373,0.507,0.64,0.76,0.88,0.96,1.013,1.067,1.12,1.16,1.2,1.28,1.328,1.376,1.424,1.472,1.52,1.6,1.64,1.68,1.72,1.76,1.92,2.08,2.16,2.2,2.24,2.28,2.32,2.4,2.427,2.453,2.48,2.52,2.533,2.547,2.56,2.64,2.72,2.8,2.88,3.12,3.36,3.44,3.467,3.493,3.52,3.6,3.653,3.707,3.76,3.84,3.872,3.904,3.936,3.968,4,4.04,4.06,4.08,4.16,4.24,4.44,4.469,4.497,4.526,4.554,4.583,4.611,4.64,5.12,5.16,5.173,5.187,5.2,5.28,5.34,5.4,5.46,5.52,5.58,5.64,5.7,5.76,5.84,5.867,5.893,5.92,6,6.04,6.08,6.16,6.32,6.48,6.64,6.8,6.853,6.907,6.924,6.942,6.96,7.04,7.12,7.2,7.28,7.36,7.44,7.493,7.547,7.6,7.68,7.72,7.76,8.16,8.2,8.213,8.227,8.24,8.32,8.4,8.56,8.587,8.613,8.64,8.667,8.693,8.72,8.88,8.933,8.987,9.04,9.12,9.143,9.166,9.189,9.211,9.234,9.257,9.28,9.36,9.44,9.52,9.56,9.6,9.653,9.707,9.76,9.813,9.867,9.92,10.32,10.36,10.4,10.44,10.48,10.52,10.56,10.6,10.64,10.68,10.72,10.8,10.88,10.9,10.92,10.94,10.96,11.08,11.1,11.12,11.14,11.16,11.18,11.2,11.28,11.307,11.333,11.36,11.44,11.5,11.56,11.62,11.68,11.76,1